              "value": 4
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You have a connection to the healing properties of nature and can produce a magical mist to heal damage and stop burning or bleeding. You gain the soothing mist warden spell. Increase the number of Focus Points in your focus pool by 1."
            }
          }
